OL,3,GNEWSA'It's a full circle moment' -
OL,4,AFriends go from Emerge crowd to
OL,5,Aperformers
OL,6,
OL,7,FBest friends Andrew Cairns, Ben
OL,8,FDonnelly and Reece Harvey are
OL,9,Fexperiencing a "full-circle" moment
OL,10,Fthat they all find quite unbelievable.
OL,12,FJust four years ago, they were part of
OL,13,Fthe massive crowd, staring up at the
OL,14,Fstage as some of the world's biggest
OL,15,Fdance acts performed at the first
OL,16,FEmerge festival.
OL,18,FThey have been back every year since.
OL,19,FOne of them also even previously helped
OL,20,Fbuild the stage.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
