OL,3,GNEWSA'It's a full circle moment' -
OL,4,AFriends go from Emerge crowd to
OL,5,Aperformers
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis weekend, they will be there again,
OL,8,Fonly this time on the stage itself with
OL,9,Fhoards of fans staring up at them.
